"},{"open":"13:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"13:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"13:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"13:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"13:00","close":"20:00"}]},"summary":"Bún mắm is an extremely pungent noodle dish made with a fermented fish sauce called mắm nêm. Mắm nêm can best be described as \"smells like hell, tastes like heaven.\" Bún Mắm Vân is in what is called \"Bún Mắm Alley\" where a few bún mắm shops have congregated. You can smell this alley from a block away. Try the bún mắm thịt quay or bún mắm with roasted pork. If you are put off by the smell of strong","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_com_nieu_nha_do","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Com Nieu Nha Do","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.05951,"lng":108.20538},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_com_nieu_nha_do","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["comnieunhado","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"Cơm niêu is a type of rice that's baked in a clay pot and served with any number of sides — beef, chicken, fish, hot pot — but it's the way it's served that catches your attention. Waiters come out of the kitchen bearing hot clay pots straight out of the oven, pull out hammers, smash them at your table, and fling the crusty, baked rice inside back and forth across the room. Otherwise, the food is ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_memory_lounge","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Memory Lounge","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.07262,"lng":108.22517},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_memory_lounge","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["memorylounge","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"07:00","close":"23:30"},{"open":"07:00","close":"23:30"},{"open":"07:00","close":"23:30"},{"open":"07:00","close":"23:30"},{"open":"07:00","close":"23:30"},{"open":"07:00","close":"23:30"},{"open":"07:00","close":"23:30"}]},"summary":"Quite possibly the most expensive place to go for coffee in Da Nang. The high-end Memory Lounge overlooks the river — in fact, it was built directly on top, jutting out onto the river and accessible from the promenade. Built by the wife of a former president of South Vietnam, it's quite a fancy affair — with foreign chefs blending Asian and European cuisines and using organic and sustainable ingre","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_quan_dung_my_quang","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Quán Dung Mỳ Quảng","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.08157,"lng":108.23148},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_quan_dung_my_quang","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["quandungmyquang","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"06:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"Well known for their mì quảng cá lóc, the best known noodle dish of Đà Nẵng, served with broad rice noodles, fresh greens, a broth seasoned with turmeric, shallots and garlic topped and with peanuts. It is served in a shallow and pungent pool of broth unlike its better known cousin phở, which is milder and fills the bowl. Cá lóc is snakehead fish; when prepared correctly, which this place is known","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_taco_ngon","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Taco NGON","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.04906,"lng":108.2441},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_taco_ngon","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["tacongon","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Small taco restaurant. The tacos are nice (recommended is the BBQ pork), as are the fresh fries and the tortilla chips. If you're expecting them to open a pack of Doritos and put it on the plate, you're wrong. They fry the tortilla chips to order so they come warm and full of flavour. The owner is enthusiastic and always smiling. It's no stress and has a curbside street food vibe.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_mi_quang_1a","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Mi Quang 1A","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.07245,"lng":108.21905},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_mi_quang_1a","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["miquang1a","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"06:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"06:30","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"Mi Quang 1A is one of the best known mì quảng restaurants in the area. While still good it has lost a bit of its luster over the years. Prices are higher than most places at 30,000 to 45,000 dong (Jan 2018). Make sure you are in Mi Quang 1A as there is a \"copycat\" place next door. Before going in grab a fresh sugarcane juice from the cart in the front.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_long_coffee","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Long Coffee","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":16.07486,"lng":108.21995},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_long_coffee","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["longcoffee","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Crazy popular cà phê cóc-style coffee shop in Da Nang that serves and sells its own brand of coffee—not the best, according to some, but very popular with locals. It's always busy, noisy and smoky, but that's part of the atmosphere. Go there with a local friend to shoot the breeze and enjoy a quintessential Vietnamese experience.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_ngoc_huong","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Ngoc Huong","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.0735,"lng":108.2447},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_ngoc_huong","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["ngochuong","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A typical but tasty live seafood neon emporium, with the motto \"there is no seafood that is not available\", as a glance at the nightmare fuel giant isopod tank will confirm. Fear not, they also have everything else from shrimp to imported Alaskan king crab, plus a wide variety of local molluscs, hotpot, and more.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_festival_disco","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Festival Disco","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":16.0644,"lng":108.2302},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_festival_disco","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["festivaldisco","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"The newest disco and the only one on the My Khe Beach side of the river. It's part of a complex with a restaurant and karaoke rooms. If you buy the staff a drink here (a normal thing to do in this kind of disco-night club) they can be very aggressive about drinking it fast and running up a big bill for you.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_com_nha_linh","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Cơm Nhà Linh","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.05531,"lng":108.24488},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_com_nha_linh","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["comnhalinh","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Delicious food, true to the homemade style, suitable for the North. The set menu is full of meat, fish, soup, vegetables, peanuts and eggs. If you are craving something local, they don't disappoint. Great experience to grill your own meat at the table. The service might be a bit slow though.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_red_hot_bar","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Red Hot Bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":16.0602,"lng":108.2102},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_red_hot_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["redhotbar","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"A real late night place. (\"Late night\" is more flexible in Da Nang than in Hanoi. Most of the time discos and places like Red Hot, an approximations of a Thai girlie-bar, close at 01:00 or 01:30, but if the police decide to crack down, they may unexpectedly close at midnight or 00:30).","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_quan_thao","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Quán Thảo","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":16.07206,"lng":108.24035},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_quan_thao","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["quanthao","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"06:00","close":"10:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"10:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"10:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"10:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"10:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"10:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"10:00"}]},"summary":"Traditional street food establishment frequented mostly by locals for breakfast, on a quiet side road. While Ms Thảo serves Mì Quảng or [Province of] Quảng style noodles, she's known for her bún bò or beef noodle soup. Some like to add a baguette for an additional 5,000 dong.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_green_town_bar","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Green Town Bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":16.0737,"lng":108.2244},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_green_town_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["greentownbar","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"One of relatively few bars open past the witching hour and most expats drop in there for either an early evening or late night drink. The view is excellent with an outdoor terrace and 2 big pool tables inside. The prices are very reasonable. Food is available until 22:00.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_hai_quynh_cafe","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Hai Quynh Café","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":16.05454,"lng":108.21722},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_hai_quynh_cafe","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["haiquynhcafe","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Known as the \"Rock Coffee Shop\", where you can enjoy coffee and listen to rock music at the same time. You can request songs. Usually, they play ballads and soft rock in the daytime and hard rock and metal in the evening (very loudly).","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"},{"id":"da_nang_wv_ca_fe_49","areaId":"da_nang","name":"Ca Fe 49","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":16.07364,"lng":108.24148},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"da_nang_wv_ca_fe_49","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafe49","danang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"06:00","close":"15:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"15:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"15:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"15:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"15:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"15:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"15:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Ca Fe 49 is a simple, family-run, outdoor cafe serving excellent coffee at a good price. Enjoy a \"cà phê sữa đá Đà Nẵng\" while enjoying a quiet view. The husband and wife owners are friendly. Recommend if you are out in Sơn Trà.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Da Nang"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}